<witsml:statusInfo><witsml:reportNo>6</witsml:reportNo><witsml:dTim>2015-02-01T00:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTim><witsml:md uom="m">1206</witsml:md><witsml:dTimDiaHoleStart>2015-01-29T11:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimDiaHoleStart><witsml:mdDiaHoleStart uom="m">1206</witsml:mdDiaHoleStart><witsml:strengthForm uom="g/cm3">0</witsml:strengthForm><witsml:mdStrengthForm uom="m">0</witsml:mdStrengthForm><witsml:tvdStrengthForm uom="m">0</witsml:tvdStrengthForm><witsml:mdCsgLast uom="m">1201</witsml:mdCsgLast><witsml:tvdCsgLast uom="m">1012</witsml:tvdCsgLast><witsml:mdPlanned uom="m">-999.99</witsml:mdPlanned><witsml:distDrill uom="m">-999.99</witsml:distDrill><witsml:elevKelly uom="m">54.9</witsml:elevKelly><witsml:wellheadElevation uom="m">20.9</witsml:wellheadElevation><witsml:waterDepth uom="m">91</witsml:waterDepth><witsml:sum24Hr>Installed back-up Timelock plug in 9 5/8&quot; liner. Attempted to pressure test casing without success. POOH with plug RT. Pulled diverter and surface riser. Installed and blinded off tubing bonnet. Lined up cement unit to WH and pressure test well against Timelock plug and tubing to 35 bar. Good test.    </witsml:sum24Hr><witsml:forecast24Hr>R/U wireline
