<witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-01-31T00:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-01-31T01:45:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">409</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>equipment failure</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Continued RIH with Timelock plug on 5 1/2&quot; DP from 168 m to 409 m. Avg. tripping speed 138 m/hr. Electrical Technician had to override/force singnal into control system to be able to operate PRS.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-01-31T01:45:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-01-31T02:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">436</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>equipment failure</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>M/U TDS and washed down to setting depth, 300 lpm. Recorded up/down weights: 78 t / 86 ton and free rotational torque / weight at 10 rpm: 1000 Nm / 80 ton. Sat Timelock plug and closed ball valve according to Archer procedure. Pressured up string to 45 bar to verify ball valve closed. Packer mid element at 434,67 m.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-01-31T02:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-01-31T02:45:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">424</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- repair</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>equipment failure</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>M/U side entry assy.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-01-31T02:45:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-01-31T03:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">424</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- repair</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>equipment failure</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Filled well with water with rig pumps. Closed kelly cock, opened LTV and flushed lines from cement unit. Closed flowline valve and filled water above diverter packer element.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-01-31T03:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-01-31T03:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">424</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- repair</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>equipment failure</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Performed line-up test from cement, 100 bar / 5 min. Verified</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-01-31T03:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-01-31T04:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">424</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- repair</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>equipment failure</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Attempted to pressure tested well to 34 bar against Timelock plug and diverter packer. Pressured up well in steps and monitored:
11 bar / 165 ltr
24 bar / 56 ltr
26 bar / 8 ltr
28 bar / 7 ltr
29 bar / 3 ltr
30 bar / 5 ltr (pressure drop observed)
31 bar / 9 ltr 
32 bar / 8 ltr 
Aborted at 32 bar. Pressure dropped and stabilized at 23,5 bar. No good test. Bled off pressure to cement unit.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-01-31T04:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-01-31T04:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">424</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- repair</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>equipment failure</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>R/D side entry assembly.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-01-31T04:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-01-31T05:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>equipment failure</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>POOH with Timelock RT on 5 1/2&quot; DP from 424 m to 0 m. Avg. tripping speed 340 m/hr. L/D RT to deck.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-01-31T05:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-01-31T06:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>equipment failure</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Cleaned and cleared rig floor.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-01-31T06:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-01-31T07:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- repair</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>equipment failure</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>R/U for pulling diverter. Held TBT with new crew.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-01-31T07:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-01-31T08:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- repair</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>equipment failure</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Installed lifting eyes and bridle. Pulled diverter inserts. 10&quot; diverter inserts released from interlock, fell out and landed off on top of the riser.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-01-31T08:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-01-31T09:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- repair</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>equipment failure</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Evaluated situation. Troubleshot to recover 10&quot; inserts.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-01-31T09:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-01-31T11:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- repair</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>equipment failure</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Planned and prepared retrieval tool to recover 10&quot; inserts.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-01-31T11:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-01-31T11:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- repair</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>equipment failure</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Tested retrieval tool. Good test.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-01-31T11:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-01-31T11:45:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- repair</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>equipment failure</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Installed remaining retrieval tools and prepared for lifting 10&quot; inserts.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-01-31T11:45:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-01-31T12:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- repair</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>equipment failure</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Lifted 10&quot; diverter inserts and recovered same to drill floor. Performed AAR with involved personnel</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-01-31T12:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-01-31T12:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- repair</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>equipment failure</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Performed TBT for pulling diverter.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-01-31T12:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-01-31T13:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- repair</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>equipment failure</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Pulled diverter and R/B same.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-01-31T13:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-01-31T13:45:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- repair</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>equipment failure</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Re-installed master bushings and removed tension lines from riser in moonpool.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-01-31T13:45:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-01-31T16:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- repair</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>equipment failure</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Build sacffolding in moonpool for installing shackles on riser. Meanwhile cleaned and cleared drill floor.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-01-31T16:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-01-31T17:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- repair</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>equipment failure</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Installed lifting equipment onto riser. Removed scaffolding in moonpool. Drained the riser.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-01-31T17:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-01-31T18:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- repair</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>equipment failure</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>R/U and prepared to disconnect and pull riser. Performed TBT for pulling riser. Meanwhile Production Dept shut-in adjacent wells according to SimOps procedure.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-01-31T18:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-01-31T18:45:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- repair</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>equipment failure</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Nippled down riser and pulled same.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-01-31T18:45:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-01-31T19:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- repair</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>equipment failure</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Performed TBT with new crew for laying out riser joint.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-01-31T19:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-01-31T20:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- repair</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>equipment failure</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>L/D surface riser on HTS with crane assist.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-01-31T20:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-01-31T20:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>equipment failure</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Retrived bore protector, utilising tuggers in TDS.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-01-31T20:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-01-31T20:45:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>equipment failure</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Lowered tubing bonnet to XMT deck utilising TDS. Landed tubing bonnet according to Vetco instructions. Production Dept. re-stared production according to SimOps procedure after tubing bonnet landed.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-01-31T20:45:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-01-31T21:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>equipment failure</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Blinded off cable penetrator. Installed flange on tubing bonnet. Lined-up cement unit to well by connecting 1/2&quot; hose from moonpool manifold to WH.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-01-31T21:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-01-31T21:45:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>equipment failure</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Maersk and Halliburton cementer performed line walk to verify line-up. Performed TBT prior to pressure test casing.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-01-31T21:45:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-01-31T22:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- repair</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>equipment failure</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Barried off moonpool and WH area. Filled up well from cement unit. Installed needle valve at WH.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-01-31T22:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-01-31T22:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- repair</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>equipment failure</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Closed valve at WH and performed line-up test to 35 bar / 100 bar. Bled off pressure to cement unit after good test. Pressured up 10 bar, opened valve at WH and observed pressure drop.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-01-31T22:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-01-31T23:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- repair</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>equipment failure</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Pressure tested well to 35 bar against Timelock plug and tubing bonnet. Pressured up well in steps and monitored:
10 bar / 11 ltr
28 bar / 33 ltr (observed instant pressure drop to 25,5 bar when stopping pumps)
30 bar / 4 ltr (instant drop to 27,4 bar)
Continued pressuring up at lowest possible rate to reduce pressure drop when stopping pumps due to the 1/2&quot; hose.
